# Forensic pipeline transient working state — NOT a deliverable.
#
# Deliverables are the committed audit/0N-*.md files, each of which embeds its
# full schema-validated object in a ```json appendix. The orchestrator commits
# those .md files at every stage checkpoint, so completed stages stay durable
# on the branch. Everything under .work/ (logs, per-agent scratch, intermediate
# round files, resume state) is regenerable and is intentionally not tracked.
.work/
*.log
